        "body": "<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nDraft only. Do not merge.\n\nSource HEAD for the repairs is `ac7aa4b801d50fae6ddcd6eb2f5524129a40c866`. Branch tip `8a0c7dfd11277c20a8740eaa7dd4a08dc8ec03f9` only stores the bundle. The bundle itself is `artifacts/sprint-r6/delivery/frostecho-r6.bundle`, SHA256 `683763a876941bb55710216abfb6a03124dec2e6ae0adc7d5ff8fdb4f8d3c230`, and it records `cf1ed793be0b45b8a86d8fda4ef72db7e5176383` so it does not contain itself.\n\nOne session. No GPU, no weight download, no model API. Training and execution gates stay closed.\n\nThe four R5 gaps were reproduced first (`artifacts/sprint-r6/run01/baseline`) and then closed on CPU fixtures. The four-morning story matches across a continuous process and a save/quit process at 4394 simulated minutes.\n\nThe frozen `final_check.py` run did not finish: `eval-full` hit the tool's 900 second cap, and a streamed diagnostic stalled in the existing `g04-cli` live test. That is recorded, not treated as a pass.\n\nThe task-pack branch `r6-taskpack-20261113` is not on the remote, so this draft targets `main` only as a review base. It is not for merging.\n\nShort report: `artifacts/sprint-r6/delivery/REPORT.txt`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-0c777bb8-2a40-5165-9da6-ddb6f214fcc0?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-0c777bb8-2a40-5165-9da6-ddb6f214fcc0&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dar